{"video_id":"jgy-012","points":[{"kp_id":"jgy-012.kp0001","video_id":"jgy-012","type":"clinical_tip","statement":"金匮五脏风寒积聚篇残缺最多，现存条文需结合脉证补释。","evidence_quote":"风寒积蓄","start_s":0.05,"end_s":8.61,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-012.kp0002","video_id":"jgy-012","type":"pathomechanism","statement":"肺中风则上焦燥热，口燥而喘、身肿；津不上承如无云蔽日。","evidence_quote":"口燥","start_s":51.37,"end_s":58.61,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-012.kp0003","video_id":"jgy-012","type":"pathomechanism","statement":"肺中寒则津停，吐浊涕、咳唾，肺气衰败可见葱叶无根死脉。","evidence_quote":"肺里面是寒","start_s":216.08,"end_s":220.895,"confidence":0.85},{"kp_id":"jgy-012.kp0004","video_id":"jgy-012","type":"clinical_tip","statement":"肝中风两胁痛头目眩，临床可按少阳投小柴胡，不必死记条文。","evidence_quote":"小柴胡汤","start_s":415.57,"end_s":424.695,"confidence":0.85},{"kp_id":"jgy-012.kp0005","video_id":"jgy-012","type":"pathomechanism","statement":"肝中寒则肝脾肿大顶膈，胸中痛不得转侧，食则吐而喜静。","evidence_quote":"胸中痛","start_s":467.69,"end_s":474.785,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-012.kp0006","video_id":"jgy-012","type":"formula_indication","statement":"肝着（寒凝肝血不入肺）其人常欲蹈其胸上，旋覆花汤主之。","evidence_quote":"悬浮花","start_s":709.84,"end_s":713.985,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-012.kp0007","video_id":"jgy-012","type":"formula_composition","statement":"旋覆花汤用旋覆花降逆、葱通阳、新绛（茜草）活血入肝；亦治妇科瘀痛。","evidence_quote":"芡草","start_s":730.02,"end_s":743.315,"confidence":0.85},{"kp_id":"jgy-012.kp0008","video_id":"jgy-012","type":"formula_indication","statement":"心中风上焦热、心中饥饥不欲食而吐，防己黄芪汤类主之。","evidence_quote":"黄芪汤","start_s":972.3,"end_s":972.845,"confidence":0.85},{"kp_id":"jgy-012.kp0009","video_id":"jgy-012","type":"formula_indication","statement":"心中寒如蒜状、心痛彻背属寒痰；脉浮可自愈，不愈用乌头赤石脂丸。","evidence_quote":"乌头","start_s":1066.87,"end_s":1069.475,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-012.kp0010","video_id":"jgy-012","type":"pathomechanism","statement":"心伤则火不上达小肠，头面赤、下重（里急后重感）、烦热脐跳脉弦。","evidence_quote":"下重","start_s":1252.343,"end_s":1258.108,"confidence":0.85},{"kp_id":"jgy-012.kp0011","video_id":"jgy-012","type":"pathomechanism","statement":"邪哭魂魄不安属血气少；阴气衰为癫、阳气衰为狂，可从肝肺心论治。","evidence_quote":"阴气衰","start_s":1552.153,"end_s":1557.838,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-012.kp0012","video_id":"jgy-012","type":"pathomechanism","statement":"脾中风湿盛：发热形如醉人、腹中烦重、目润短气；湿阻心火不降。","evidence_quote":"形如醉人","start_s":1724.183,"end_s":1729.278,"confidence":0.95},{"kp_id":"jgy-012.kp0013","video_id":"jgy-012","type":"treatment_principle","statement":"脾湿当利尿去湿，不可发汗；汗出快湿行慢，反伤津而腹大依旧。","evidence_quote":"不能发汗","start_s":1831.873,"end_s":1838.093,"confidence":0.95},{"kp_id":"jgy-012.kp0014","video_id":"jgy-012","type":"clinical_tip","statement":"脾湿利水常用白术茯苓；少腹静脉瘀滞可重用白芍一两配茯苓。","evidence_quote":"白术跟茯苓","start_s":1882.383,"end_s":1885.778,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-012.kp0015","video_id":"jgy-012","type":"formula_indication","statement":"肝藏血可用酸枣仁辈敛血入肝；心主血用黄芩黄连阿胶苦入心。","evidence_quote":"酸枣仁","start_s":1950.553,"end_s":1958.403,"confidence":0.85},{"kp_id":"jgy-012.kp0016","video_id":"jgy-012","type":"formula_indication","statement":"脾约：胃热约束脾津，浮涩脉、大便坚，麻子仁丸主之。","evidence_quote":"麻子仁丸","start_s":2101.723,"end_s":2114.328,"confidence":0.95}]}